  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 29-layer thin-film stack on SiO2 (Gao) substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence from air to substrate: HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2 (cavity), MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2. All 29 layer thicknesses are optimizable variables. Wavelength bands: maximize transmittance in 255-280 nm, minimize transmittance in 300-700 nm, minimize transmittance in 700-1100 nm. Normal incidence, unpolarized light. No metal layers. Total layer count fixed at 29.",
